<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, markets start quietly.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, markets start quietly.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $326.00 vs $327.55 previously. Quiet so far in $325.00-$330 overall range. Some help from weaker dollar.</p>
<p>Forecast to remain within middle of range.</p>
<p>SILVER - Two cents firmer at $4.39/$4.41. Quiet.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $1.00 at $428.00/$431.00. Little interest.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $3.00 at $210.00/$213.00. Still very tight.</p>
<p>Boosted by spec short covering on Tocom.</p>
</text>
